00:15:22.266 --> 00:15:26.766
To really understand a climate cover text, forget the idea of a majority vote.

00:15:27.166 --> 00:15:29.686
What follows is my own explanation of that rule.

00:15:29.686 --> 00:15:32.346
Not a line taken from one article today.

00:15:32.926 --> 00:15:36.486
The big political statement at these summits is adopted by consensus.

00:15:37.086 --> 00:15:40.486
That means it passes only if no government in the room blocks it.

00:15:40.966 --> 00:15:46.066
