00:15:53.506 --> 00:15:55.346
the single text everyone must sign.

00:15:55.346 --> 00:16:00.106
line, so a meeting can fail on its cover statement and still produce a coalition promise.

00:16:00.786 --> 00:16:02.446
And those are not the same piece of paper.

00:16:03.086 --> 00:16:07.366
Next time a headline says a climate meeting collapsed or broke through, check which

00:16:07.366 --> 00:16:12.746
